---
// Tarjetas de marquesina 1 (Izquierda a Derecha)
function toursMarkup() {
    return `
        <div class="w-80 p-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#D4A373] shadow-lg flex-shrink-0" style="background-color: var(--card-bg);">
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AFqWovRMle4" target="_blank" class="block aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-3 shadow-md relative group cursor-pointer">
                <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/AFqWovRMle4/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Tour PiCaSo" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-black/40 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#A94438] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        ▶
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm px-1" style="color: var(--text-color);">Video Promocional de la Ruta PiCaSo</h4>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#A94438] px-1 font-semibold">Piel, Calzado y Sombrero</span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-80 p-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#D4A373] shadow-lg flex-shrink-0" style="background-color: var(--card-bg);">
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a6XiLD1tTQw" target="_blank" class="block aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-3 shadow-md relative group cursor-pointer">
                <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/a6XiLD1tTQw/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Rutas de México" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-black/40 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#A94438] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        ▶
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm px-1" style="color: var(--text-color);">Rutas de México: Ruta PiCaSo</h4>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#A94438] px-1 font-semibold">Cultura y Tradición</span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-80 p-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#D4A373] shadow-lg flex-shrink-0" style="background-color: var(--card-bg);">
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AFqWovRMle4" target="_blank" class="block aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-3 shadow-md relative group cursor-pointer">
                <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/AFqWovRMle4/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Experiencia Vivencial" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-black/40 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#A94438] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        ▶
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm px-1" style="color: var(--text-color);">Experiencia Vivencial en León</h4>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#A94438] px-1 font-semibold">Turismo Artesanal</span>
        </div>
    `;
}

// Tarjetas de marquesina 2 (Derecha a Izquierda)
function toursMarkupReverse() {
    return `
        <div class="w-80 p-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#D4A373] shadow-lg flex-shrink-0" style="background-color: var(--card-bg);">
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a6XiLD1tTQw" target="_blank" class="block aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-3 shadow-md relative group cursor-pointer">
                <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/a6XiLD1tTQw/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Recorrido Talleres" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-black/40 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#A94438] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        ▶
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm px-1" style="color: var(--text-color);">Recorrido por los Talleres</h4>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#A94438] px-1 font-semibold">Industria Leonesa</span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-80 p-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#D4A373] shadow-lg flex-shrink-0" style="background-color: var(--card-bg);">
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AFqWovRMle4" target="_blank" class="block aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-3 shadow-md relative group cursor-pointer">
                <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/AFqWovRMle4/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Testimonios" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-black/40 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#A94438] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        ▶
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm px-1" style="color: var(--text-color);">Testimonios de Visitantes</h4>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#A94438] px-1 font-semibold">Turismo Internacional</span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-80 p-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#D4A373] shadow-lg flex-shrink-0" style="background-color: var(--card-bg);">
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a6XiLD1tTQw" target="_blank" class="block aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-3 shadow-md relative group cursor-pointer">
                <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/a6XiLD1tTQw/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Patrimonio y Calzado" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-black/40 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#A94438] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        ▶
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm px-1" style="color: var(--text-color);">Patrimonio y Calzado</h4>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#A94438] px-1 font-semibold">Orgullo de Guanajuato</span>
        </div>
    `;
}
---

<div>
    <!-- Testimonios con Videos en Marquee Infinito -->
    <section id="testimonios" class="py-24 px-6 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 reveal-on-scroll">
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 font-serif" style="color: var(--text-color);" data-i18n="test-title">Testimonios y Videos</h2>
            <p class="font-light" style="color: var(--subtext-color);" data-i18n="test-subtitle">Vive a través de los videos oficiales lo que nuestros visitantes experimentan en la Ruta PiCaSo.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Contenedor de Marquesinas -->
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 relative w-full overflow-hidden py-4">
            
            <!-- Desvanecidos laterales -->
            <div class="absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-0 w-24 bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--bg-color)] to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>
            <div class="absolute top-0 bottom-0 right-0 w-24 bg-gradient-to-l from-[var(--bg-color)] to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>

            <!-- Marquee 1: Izquierda a Derecha (Cuatro bloques clonados para bucle sin fin perfecto) -->
            <div class="flex w-max animate-marquee space-x-6">
                <Fragment set:html={toursMarkup()} />
                <Fragment set:html={toursMarkup()} />
                <Fragment set:html={toursMarkup()} />
                <Fragment set:html={toursMarkup()} />
            </div>

            <!-- Marquee 2: Derecha a Izquierda (Cuatro bloques clonados) -->
            <div class="flex w-max animate-marquee-reverse space-x-6">
                <Fragment set:html={toursMarkupReverse()} />
                <Fragment set:html={toursMarkupReverse()} />
                <Fragment set:html={toursMarkupReverse()} />
                <Fragment set:html={toursMarkupReverse()} />
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="text-center mt-12 reveal-on-scroll">
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@picasotours3476/videos" target="_blank" class="inline-block border-2 border-[#A94438] text-[#A94438] hover:bg-[#A94438] hover:text-white font-bold px-8 py-3 rounded-full transition-colors duration-300 shadow-sm" data-i18n="btn-youtube">
                Ver más en YouTube
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Blog / Cultura Zapatera -->
    <section id="blog" class="py-24 px-6 bg-[#241C15] text-white">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 reveal-on-scroll">
                <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 font-serif text-[#FDFBF7]" data-i18n="blog-title">Cultura Zapatera</h2>
                <p class="text-[#D4A373] font-light" data-i18n="blog-subtitle">Artículos y curiosidades sobre la industria legendaria de León.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="bg-[#3D2C1E] p-6 rounded-3xl border border-[#5C4033] hover:border-[#D4A373] transition-colors reveal-on-scroll">
                    <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#A94438] mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide" data-i18n="blog-tag-1">Historia</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 font-serif" data-i18n="blog-h-1">El origen de la curtiduría en León</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mb-6 line-clamp-3" data-i18n="blog-p-1">Descubre cómo los primeros asentamientos en el Bajío moldearon la capital mundial de la piel y el calzado...</p>
                    <a href="#" class="text-[#D4A373] font-bold text-sm hover:underline" data-i18n="blog-read-1">Leer más →</a>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-[#3D2C1E] p-6 rounded-3xl border border-[#5C4033] hover:border-[#D4A373] transition-colors reveal-on-scroll">
                    <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#A94438] mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide" data-i18n="blog-tag-2">Procesos</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 font-serif" data-i18n="blog-h-2">De la piel al aparado: El arte del zapato</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mb-6 line-clamp-3" data-i18n="blog-p-2">Paso a paso, conoce el meticuloso proceso de fabricar calzado artesanal de calidad de exportación...</p>
                    <a href="#" class="text-[#D4A373] font-bold text-sm hover:underline" data-i18n="blog-read-2">Leer más →</a>
                </div>
                <div class="bgHash bg-[#3D2C1E] p-6 rounded-3xl border border-[#5C4033] hover:border-[#D4A373] transition-colors reveal-on-scroll">
                    <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#A94438] mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide" data-i18n="blog-tag-3">Tradición</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 font-serif" data-i18n="blog-h-3">San Pancho: La capital del Sombrero</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mb-6 line-clamp-3" data-i18n="blog-p-3">Un viaje a San Francisco del Rincón para entender por qué sus sombreros visten a personalidades de todo el mundo...</p>
                    <a href="#" class="text-[#D4A373] font-bold text-sm hover:underline" data-i18n="blog-read-3">Leer más →</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>